<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Universal Outdoor started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Universal Outdoor started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette initiated coverage of Universal Outdoor Holdings Inc with an outperform rating, according to a DLJ source.</p>
<p>-- In midmorning Nasdaq trade, the stock gained 5/8 to 34-1/8, just under the year-high 34-1/4.</p>
